WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.234 --> 00:00:02.227
- [Conan] You see Chris and Moses, Andy?

2
00:00:02.227 --> 00:00:03.508
- I do, there they are, they're right in front of me,

3
00:00:03.508 --> 00:00:04.858
it's like I can touch 'em!

4
00:00:04.858 --> 00:00:06.494
- [Conan] Yeah, they're on the rooftop right now,

5
00:00:06.494 --> 00:00:07.664
and I think there they are, yes!

6
00:00:07.664 --> 00:00:09.361
(audience cheers)

7
00:00:09.361 --> 00:00:10.194
- Hey!

8
00:00:10.194 --> 00:00:11.505
- [Conan] How are you guys?

9
00:00:11.505 --> 00:00:12.338
Hey Conan.

10
00:00:13.446 --> 00:00:14.465
- [Conan] Incredible.

11
00:00:14.465 --> 00:00:16.679
- I don't know where I'm at, this is beautiful.

12
00:00:16.679 --> 00:00:17.716
- [Conan] Yeah, it's beautiful.

13
00:00:17.716 --> 00:00:19.599
What a sad set we built for them.

14
00:00:19.599 --> 00:00:21.312
(audience laughs)

15
00:00:21.312 --> 00:00:22.434
- Conan do you like our set?

16
00:00:22.434 --> 00:00:23.905
- [Conan] Yeah, it looks yeah.

17
00:00:23.905 --> 00:00:26.906
It's a rejected outhouse from Jurassic Park.

18
00:00:26.906 --> 00:00:30.301
Crazy here, as always, ComiCon is amazingly crowded.

19
00:00:30.301 --> 00:00:32.295
Isn't it amazing, it is so crowded.

20
00:00:32.295 --> 00:00:34.847
(crowd cheers)

21
00:00:34.847 --> 00:00:36.684
Here's how crowded ComiCon is.

22
00:00:36.684 --> 00:00:38.067
I had to wait in line for three hours

23
00:00:38.067 --> 00:00:39.880
just to host this show.

24
00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:42.013
(audience laughs)

25
00:00:42.013 --> 00:00:43.368
I sat there, just waiting.

26
00:00:43.368 --> 00:00:46.368
(audience applause)

27
00:00:48.172 --> 00:00:50.777
- How did it feel, is my question, Luke.

28
00:00:50.777 --> 00:00:54.610
When you declared a boundary with your father.

29
00:00:55.586 --> 00:00:57.145
- [Luke] He cut off my hand.

30
00:00:57.145 --> 00:00:59.383
- I sure would like you to use those

31
00:00:59.383 --> 00:01:00.422
"I feel" statements.

32
00:01:00.422 --> 00:01:02.833
I feel bad, I feel sad, I feel.

33
00:01:02.833 --> 00:01:05.065
- [Luke] I feel like flipping you off right now.

34
00:01:05.065 --> 00:01:06.196
(audience laughs)

35
00:01:06.196 --> 00:01:07.303
Both of you.

36
00:01:07.303 --> 00:01:09.001
- Okay, could have been more effective.

37
00:01:09.001 --> 00:01:11.010
I don't know why you didn't use the good hand,

38
00:01:11.010 --> 00:01:13.646
which would make flipping off much more effective there.

39
00:01:13.646 --> 00:01:16.255
- [Conan] From the stars of Kingsmen, the Gold Circle,

40
00:01:16.255 --> 00:01:19.218
Jeff Bridges, Channing Tatum, Halle Barry!

41
00:01:19.218 --> 00:01:21.418
(audience cheering)

42
00:01:21.418 --> 00:01:24.168
(big band music)

43
00:01:47.298 --> 00:01:49.930
- There's a bank robbery going on right now,

44
00:01:49.930 --> 00:01:51.037
you need to get there right away.

45
00:01:51.037 --> 00:01:51.870
- [Conan] You gave me a little too much.

46
00:01:51.870 --> 00:01:54.361
Let's take it down a little, just say this bank robbery.

47
00:01:54.361 --> 00:01:55.913
- There's a bank robbery going on right now,

48
00:01:55.913 --> 00:01:56.881
you need to get there.

49
00:01:56.881 --> 00:01:58.370
- [Conan] Still not satisfied, but okay.

50
00:01:58.370 --> 00:01:59.494
I'll get them.

51
00:01:59.494 --> 00:02:01.343
(audience laughs)

52
00:02:01.343 --> 00:02:04.002
Oh jeez (grunting).

53
00:02:04.002 --> 00:02:05.169
Okay, hold on.

54
00:02:06.945 --> 00:02:09.080
Hold on, there's nowhere for this foot to go.

55
00:02:09.080 --> 00:02:10.915
Shut the door, shut the door.

56
00:02:10.915 --> 00:02:13.106
(audience laughs)

57
00:02:13.106 --> 00:02:15.375
This doesn't really instill fear, does it?

58
00:02:15.375 --> 00:02:17.546
God, who fits in this?

59
00:02:17.546 --> 00:02:19.510
This is like the Kevin Hart-mobile.

60
00:02:19.510 --> 00:02:20.932
(audience laughs)

61
00:02:20.932 --> 00:02:25.099
(big band music and audience cheering)

